   "body": "/claim mac/m4-captures\n\n- `R45a` (`/hfr/Discussions/nouveau_sujet.htm`) has no poll fields: only its submit check names `have_sondage` and `annee`.\n- The list pages link a separate form, `/hfr/Discussions/nouveau_sondage.htm` (`R04`), which legacy reads through `have_sondage` (`Classes/AddMessageViewController.m:521` @ `87fe0d1c`).\n- Read-only: one GET of that form, logged in (user1), anonymized, never submitted; one draft PR `capture/170-new-poll-form`.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
