   "body": "### Capture result\n\nPR #740 holds `R170a`, the new-poll form, captured 2026-11-10 with one read-only GET.\n\n- **Where the poll lives:** `/hfr/<cat>/nouveau_sondage.htm` is the new-topic form with a hidden `sond=1` and the poll block. The fields are `textreponse0` (question), `textreponse1`-`10` (answers, 255 characters each), `allowvisitor`, `max_votes` 1-10 and the closing date.\n- **No `have_sondage`:** neither new-topic form has a `have_sondage` input; the first-post edit form `R63b` does.\n- **What this changes:** HFR-PROTOCOL §6b \"New poll\" and the LOT-100 spec fixtures. The legacy finding is noted on #191.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
